    "commit": "17caf99f6ee1a8b3bd0fd4fe556f571df125ebdb",
    "commit_body": "When the pre-MACD weighted score is < 45, zero MACD's weight and\nredistribute proportionally to trend/BB/RSI/Stoch/TA. MACD is a lagging\nmomentum indicator that stays positive until breakdown is confirmed,\nsuppressing genuine put signals. The gate removes this drag on bearish\nsetups while preserving MACD's contribution on calls.\n\nValidated 2026-04-17 via experiments/asymmetric_macd_ablation.py (5y\nfull universe, 803k scored pairs, diff-assessed vs v17 DB):\n- <25 WR15: 63.4% -> 67.7% (+4.3pp)\n- <15 WR15: 63.3% -> 69.8% (+6.5pp)\n- Call side entirely preserved (95+/90+/75+/70+ within noise)\n\nMade-with: Cursor",
    "commit_short": "17caf99f",
    "commit_subject": "Asymmetric MACD gate for puts",
